WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:04.500
I've got three more ideas than this guy.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.809
It's quality over quantity.

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:09.159
Throwing out a bunch of useless ideas
is just a waste of time.

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:12.129
These two competing is the
Sales Department's main event.

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:14.980
They jump at any chance
to one-up each other.

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:16.880
What the hell is going on?

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:18.370
What's going on?

00:00:18.371 --> 00:00:19.451
We're competing, obviously.

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:21.350
You're the one who started it.

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:22.740
What are you doing?!

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:24.140
Wait a second.

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:26.380
There.

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:28.480
I win.

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:31.270
This is the worst.

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:32.690
I'm going home.

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:34.070
Hey.

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:37.920
I...

00:00:37.990 --> 00:00:39.210
haven't finished yet.

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:07.040
Are you okay?

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:09.750
Shut up.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.120
And whose fault do you think that is?

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:15.010
Fair point.

00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:21.730
If your body gets to the point
where it can't live without me...

00:01:22.090 --> 00:01:23.090
Then I'm sorry.

00:01:23.510 --> 00:01:24.610
Same to you!

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:27.269
If you fall for me and can't
date women anymore,

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:28.270
don't come crying to me.

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:29.980
Huh?

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:33.220
You're definitely the one
who's gonna fall for me.

00:01:35.560 --> 00:01:38.170
There's no way I'd ever
fall for someone like you.

00:01:39.130 --> 00:01:41.340
I'm not interested in you either...

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:45.370
In that case...

00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:47.620
Wanna give it a shot?

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:48.620
Huh?

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:50.700
Let's make it a game.

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:55.160
You're on.

00:01:57.330 --> 00:01:58.330
Then...

00:01:58.730 --> 00:02:00.830
First one to make the
other fall in love wins.

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:02.980
Deal.

00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:26.460
Huh?

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:27.390
Onishi.

00:02:27.391 --> 00:02:29.409
Is the teaser ad info in here?

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:30.410
Uh...

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:31.860
Wait.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:34.920
Higashino?

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:37.639
Hey, we have to reprint these again.

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:39.060
I'm so sorry! I'll get right on it!

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:41.010
I'm sorry.

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:43.090
It's fine, we still have time.

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:44.810
Ah.

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:46.619
I have something else to prepare.

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:47.860
I'll be in the conference room.

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:49.240
Call me if you need anything.

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:50.260
Got it.

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:52.650
Will you be okay on your own?

00:02:53.430 --> 00:02:54.530
Let me help.

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:56.610
Oh, I'm almost done, it's fine.

00:02:56.990 --> 00:02:57.990
More importantly,

00:02:58.140 --> 00:02:59.660
go check on Higashino.

00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:01.690
- Okay.
- Thanks.

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:11.326
[Corporate deck slides
about social media]

00:03:18.690 --> 00:03:19.690
Yo.

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:21.600
Getting ready for the presentation?

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:37.890
Oh, Yotsuya.

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:40.080
Yesterday was really fun.

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:42.100
Um...

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:43.260
Yeah.

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:47.390
Seriously, I never get
bored when I'm with you.

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:49.660
Is that so?

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:53.230
Where is this coming from?

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:54.750
Hmm?

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:55.750
What do you mean?

00:03:57.220 --> 00:03:59.490
Anyway, back to business.

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:01.169
Are you free this weekend?

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:02.260
This weekend?

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:03.700
Hold on.

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:06.130
This weekend...

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:08.240
Yeah.

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:09.656
I don't have anything planned.

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:12.769
Great. Remember that
restaurant from that work trip?

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:14.970
The view was amazing
and the food was great.

00:04:15.970 --> 00:04:16.780
Wanna go together?

00:04:16.781 --> 00:04:19.140
Oh? Asking me out on a date already?

00:04:19.580 --> 00:04:20.610
Why don't we

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:23.106
just book a hotel while we're at it?

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:24.130
Huh?

00:04:24.390 --> 00:04:25.430
More importantly,

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:27.440
how's your body feeling?

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:29.559
Don't just touch me.

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:32.350
Geez, you're so moody.

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:36.970
Be a little nicer to me.

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:41.180
Aren't we past that after
spending the night together?

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:43.280
Let go of me.

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:48.420
You know,

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:52.020
you get so worked up
when it comes to romance.

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:53.390
Huh?

00:04:53.391 --> 00:04:55.470
You're so competent at work,

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:58.890
but is your game still stuck
at a high school level?

00:04:59.550 --> 00:05:00.550
Listen here...

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:03.300
- Do you have any idea how popular I've been...
- But you know...

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:07.270
That side of you is actually pretty cute.

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:09.550
Don't talk down to me.

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:16.220
By the way,

00:05:17.990 --> 00:05:21.070
usually...

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:22.830
how do you seduce men?

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:24.990
Huh?

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:27.380
No, I mean,

00:05:28.446 --> 00:05:29.975
what do you usually do...

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:33.450
Listen, I've been meaning
to ask for a while now.

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:36.950
Why does the conversation always turn
to me doing stuff with men?

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:38.780
Hmm?

00:05:39.390 --> 00:05:40.720
I've never done it with a man.

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:43.990
Except for you.

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:48.500
What?!

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:50.729
No, but back then you...

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:52.080
The presentation is starting.

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:04.060
Are you serious...?

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:08.500
"Fake Fact Lips"

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:11.600
(Episode 2: Then I won't hold back)

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:13.380
- Thank you.
- Thank you very much.

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:25.050
- Good work.
- Good work.

00:07:25.330 --> 00:07:26.780
Man, Shido-san is incredible.

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:27.600
To be honest,

00:07:27.601 --> 00:07:30.360
I thought we were definitely
going to lose out this time.

00:07:30.370 --> 00:07:32.300
I didn't expect that
comeback. It was amazing.

00:07:32.850 --> 00:07:34.596
Did you predict exactly
what they were thinking?

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:36.780
No, while negotiation skills are important,

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:37.570
with things like this,

00:07:37.571 --> 00:07:39.859
if you start by thinking
about what benefits them,

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:42.430
it surprisingly ends up benefiting you too.

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:45.870
I see. It's just like romance.

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:47.710
Huh?

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:48.940
What do you mean by that?

00:07:49.260 --> 00:07:50.260
Basically,

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:52.030
don't just think about yourself.

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:54.870
If you consider the other
person and make them happy,

00:07:54.940 --> 00:07:56.059
then naturally,

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:59.970
it'll lead to a good result for you too.

00:08:00.420 --> 00:08:01.420
Onishi.

00:08:01.490 --> 00:08:02.490
Yes.

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:03.800
I see how it is.

00:08:04.030 --> 00:08:05.390
What do you mean?

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:07.370
Shido-san is just Shido-san.

00:08:07.696 --> 00:08:08.825
Whether it's work or romance,

00:08:08.850 --> 00:08:10.490
I'm sure he can conquer anything easily.

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:12.050
I...

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:13.920
When it comes to romance,

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:16.416
I don't really remember ever
trying to "conquer" anyone.

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:17.470
Huh?

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:23.146
If you had to make someone fall for you even
if they didn't like you, what would you do?

00:08:23.171 --> 00:08:24.269
What?

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:25.950
Uh... someone who doesn't like you, right?

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:27.690
Right. But

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:29.640
you have to make them fall for you.

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:32.120
Wait, what's the context here?

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:34.140
That's a tough one.

00:08:34.770 --> 00:08:36.020
But that's exactly why

00:08:37.010 --> 00:08:39.540
you have to consider what's in it for them.

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:41.490
Do your research,

00:08:42.590 --> 00:08:47.160
and focus entirely on
making them happy... I guess?

00:08:49.120 --> 00:08:50.870
Um, Shido-san,

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:52.690
somehow,

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:55.130
this conversation sounds kind of dangerous?

00:08:55.520 --> 00:08:56.330
Huh?

00:08:56.331 --> 00:08:58.189
That sounds like... a
honey trap or something...

00:08:58.190 --> 00:08:59.480
It's not like that.

00:08:59.520 --> 00:09:00.760
Of course not.

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:02.729
Well, Shido-san was the
one asking weird questions.

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:04.990
But that was helpful, thanks.

00:09:05.570 --> 00:09:06.870
I'm off to my meeting.

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:14.540
What was that all about?

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:31.910
Alright, let's head home.

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:45.000
It's fine, you go on ahead.

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:46.530
Oh, no, but...

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:48.110
Don't overthink it.

00:09:48.630 --> 00:09:51.180
Okay, then I'll head out first.

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:53.280
- See you tomorrow.
- Yeah.

00:10:06.090 --> 00:10:07.090
Okay.

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:34.300
So cold.

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:35.940
Good work today.

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:37.700
What the...

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:39.050
You're still here?

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:41.159
It's rare, staying this late.

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:44.030
Yeah... You need something?

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:46.170
Ah.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:48.050
Are you here to hit on me?

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:50.740
Because I'm exhausted.

00:10:51.010 --> 00:10:52.590
No, it's just...

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:54.200
Hmm?

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:57.900
About what you said this morning.

00:10:58.780 --> 00:10:59.780
What did I say?

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:02.180
No, well...

00:11:03.130 --> 00:11:04.690
I mean...

00:11:07.010 --> 00:11:08.050
What is it?

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:11.570
About it being your first time with a man.

00:11:13.220 --> 00:11:14.220
What about it?

00:11:14.260 --> 00:11:15.260
Uh...

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:18.210
So it was true.

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:20.420
Huh?

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:22.110
Why would I lie about that?

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:24.190
But you...

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:29.520
What?

00:11:30.380 --> 00:11:33.959
For your first time,
you were pretty damn sexy.

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:34.780
Idiot.

00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:36.090
You're being too loud.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:38.660
Yeah, but you...

00:11:38.900 --> 00:11:39.900
Um...

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:43.170
Didn't you say you weren't
against doing that with a man?

00:11:43.630 --> 00:11:45.489
I was just bluffing, okay? So what?

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:46.500
What?!

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:48.240
Then you should have...

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:49.810
resisted a bit more.

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:54.480
- You didn't exactly give me a chance to speak.
- Even so...

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:56.230
Besides,

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:02.710
what?

00:12:04.550 --> 00:12:05.550
I'd never let anyone else

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:06.920
do that to me.

00:12:10.810 --> 00:12:11.810
Anyway,

00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:13.300
have you had experience with this?

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:15.810
Well...

00:12:16.810 --> 00:12:18.360
I've had some...

00:12:19.440 --> 00:12:20.440
Since when?

00:12:20.530 --> 00:12:21.530
Huh?

00:12:21.960 --> 00:12:22.730
Since high school?

00:12:22.731 --> 00:12:23.800
No way.

00:12:24.040 --> 00:12:25.040
It was in college...

00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:27.110
Let's just drop this.

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:29.400
You know,

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:31.510
you're actually pretty popular with men.

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:32.670
Shut up.

00:12:33.070 --> 00:12:34.970
I just thought it was easier that way.

00:12:36.133 --> 00:12:37.133
Hmm.

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:38.980
So that means, back then...

00:12:39.350 --> 00:12:41.839
you were actually turned on by me?

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:42.840
Huh?

00:12:43.420 --> 00:12:46.750
So, want me to play with you again?

00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:48.350
You...

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:51.150
You're a straight guy, I
can't believe you'd say that.

00:12:52.350 --> 00:12:53.350
Aren't you scared?

00:12:53.780 --> 00:12:54.860
We've already done it once.

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:56.616
Twice or three times
won't make a difference.

00:12:56.640 --> 00:12:57.980
It's not the same.

00:12:59.890 --> 00:13:01.310
You're something else.

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:08.070
I'm not looking to be
friends with benefits.

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:13.030
Then... what else do you like?

00:13:13.260 --> 00:13:14.620
Where is this coming from?

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:17.620
Who asks a friend they've
known since high school that?

00:13:18.370 --> 00:13:19.370
Yeah.

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:21.470
I wasn't interested before.

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:34.800
But I want to get to know you better, Zen.

00:13:37.030 --> 00:13:38.950
We were always competing.

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:42.370
We never really talked
about ourselves, did we?

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:52.630
Let's take this chance

00:13:54.720 --> 00:13:56.090
to try and understand each other.

00:13:57.860 --> 00:13:58.860
And?

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:00.760
You think that'll make me fall for you?

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:03.590
Well, who knows.

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:09.350
But I'm going to make you like me.

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:12.430
You're such a fool.

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:16.690
It's more fun to be a little
foolish with this, right?

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:18.440
Ah.

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:20.510
Don't tell me

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:24.240
you're actually afraid
of falling in love with me?

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:25.760
No way.

00:14:26.036 --> 00:14:27.055
I think it's you.

00:14:27.186 --> 00:14:28.645
You can't get anyone else but me.

00:14:28.670 --> 00:14:29.790
It's a problem, isn't it?

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:30.880
Huh?

00:14:31.160 --> 00:14:32.900
Try it if you think you can handle it.

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:39.650
Then I won't hold back.

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:58.960
Oh, perfect timing.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:02.480
Cabernet. You like this, right?

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:03.810
Wait...

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:05.670
How did you know?

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:08.910
When we're out with clients,

00:15:09.640 --> 00:15:10.920
don't you always order Cabernet?

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:12.070
That's why...

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:14.180
Here.

00:15:14.230 --> 00:15:15.230
Have a seat.

00:15:16.420 --> 00:15:17.820
I mean... it's not just the wine...

00:15:18.530 --> 00:15:20.520
A glass after a shower.

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:22.460
It's the best feeling, isn't it?

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:25.680
What is with you...

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:27.590
And besides,

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:30.070
you've been really busy lately, right?

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:34.000
I thought you'd want
to relax like this today.

00:15:41.630 --> 00:15:42.630
Here.

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:44.060
Cheers.

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:56.010
Also,

00:15:57.230 --> 00:15:59.890
you're starting that
new project soon, right?

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:05.930
You've always been bad at relaxing.

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:10.310
De-stressing is important too, you know?

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:12.730
Being with you is more exhausting.

00:16:13.060 --> 00:16:14.420
Even back in high school,

00:16:14.940 --> 00:16:18.000
if you didn't get first place on an exam,
you looked like you were dying.

00:16:18.730 --> 00:16:22.689
You'd have that frown on your face all day.

00:16:22.690 --> 00:16:23.520
Stop it.

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.340
That's because you
were always provoking me.

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:27.510
The way you take everything so seriously

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:30.540
is actually really cute.

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:32.490
Stop flirting with me.

00:16:32.790 --> 00:16:34.070
This is a competition, isn't it?

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:40.830
It's not just your looks.

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:44.260
You've got a real masculine side, too.

00:16:46.210 --> 00:16:50.780
A guy like you...

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:52.780
I've never met anyone like you.

00:17:02.320 --> 00:17:03.320
Ryo...

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:08.250
You're really not honest with yourself.

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:09.680
What...?

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:13.180
If you felt that way,
you should have just told me sooner.

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:17.010
But...

00:17:18.270 --> 00:17:19.860
It's not just my looks.

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:24.230
You actually like my
body quite a bit, don't you?

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:29.320
Just admit it.

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:32.109
From now on, if it's you,

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:33.560
I might make an exception.

00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:38.290
What do you think?

00:17:39.460 --> 00:17:40.599
Starting from here...

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:42.180
No way.

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:43.980
Why?

00:17:44.810 --> 00:17:46.890
Didn't you say de-stressing is important?

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:49.050
Ah.

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:52.640
Did you know kissing has the same effect?

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:54.880
Yeah...

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:56.540
I've heard that.

00:17:58.100 --> 00:17:59.820
But that doesn't mean I'd do it with you...

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:06.550
Don't underestimate me.

00:18:07.070 --> 00:18:07.740
It's just a kiss.

00:18:07.740 --> 00:18:08.740
It's really no big deal.

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:11.420
Heh...

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:37.260
If you want to make me fall for you,

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:41.140
you'll have to do better than that.

00:18:45.550 --> 00:18:46.550
Hmm?

00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:51.450
Zen?

00:19:01.790 --> 00:19:02.820
Come here.

00:19:03.230 --> 00:19:04.230
Let's go together.

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:05.800
I'm paying, isn't that enough?

00:19:06.360 --> 00:19:07.920
Why do we have to eat together?

00:19:09.410 --> 00:19:10.410
Ah.

00:19:11.150 --> 00:19:13.040
You're always alone.

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:14.710
It's good to do this once in a while.

00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:18.130
I eat alone because I hate doing this.

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:21.350
Shouldn't the winner

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:23.180
get to call the shots?

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:25.396
There was no rule about eating together.

00:19:25.420 --> 00:19:26.530
I just added that rule.

00:19:27.280 --> 00:19:28.280
Let's eat.

00:19:45.520 --> 00:19:46.520
Hey, Zen.

00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:48.960
Don't be so casual with my name.

00:19:53.570 --> 00:19:54.570
You know, Zen...

00:19:55.680 --> 00:19:57.280
Are you always this tense, even at home?

00:19:58.300 --> 00:19:59.300
Why do you ask?

00:20:00.376 --> 00:20:04.026
It seems like your head is always bursting
with everything you've been studying.

00:20:04.460 --> 00:20:06.120
If you don't relax sometimes,

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:07.330
you're going to burn out.

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:10.500
I do relax.

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:13.120
How?

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:14.120
Huh?

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:15.760
I go home,

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:17.880
take a shower,

00:20:18.310 --> 00:20:19.550
and just space out for a while.

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:22.110
Oh, really?

00:20:23.170 --> 00:20:25.210
When I'm home alone...

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:32.680
Hmm...

00:20:34.860 --> 00:20:35.960
Why are you asking me this?

00:20:36.050 --> 00:20:37.460
You're frowning again.

00:20:38.770 --> 00:20:40.650
- Cut it out.
- You've got a crumb on your face.

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:43.050
Seriously, you...

00:20:43.790 --> 00:20:45.230
Try lying down after you eat.

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:49.290
Isn't that just living like a total slob?

00:20:49.540 --> 00:20:51.480
Just shut up and try it.

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:52.660
You should sleep too.

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:03.400
Well?

00:21:03.750 --> 00:21:04.750
Well what?

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:08.550
Someone as hardworking as you

00:21:08.900 --> 00:21:11.390
won't become a slob just from this.

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:14.940
It's just "relaxing."

00:21:29.900 --> 00:21:30.900
Ah.

00:21:32.070 --> 00:21:33.270
He's fast asleep.

00:21:35.200 --> 00:21:36.300
Hey, let go...

00:21:36.660 --> 00:21:37.760
Zen, did you know?

00:21:39.073 --> 00:21:41.343
Hugging is supposed to
be a great stress reliever.

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:43.920
My stress is through the roof right now.

00:21:44.440 --> 00:21:46.290
Sorry, I didn't notice.

00:21:47.970 --> 00:21:50.400
After working so long, once you relax,

00:21:50.810 --> 00:21:52.290
it's only natural to fall asleep.

00:21:53.940 --> 00:21:57.470
And that kiss earlier just
turned you on more, didn't it?

00:21:57.560 --> 00:21:58.660
It did not.

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:01.480
For you, Zen,

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:04.960
isn't being held like
this just what you need?

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:06.470
I told you,

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:08.830
this is only giving me more stress.

00:22:09.990 --> 00:22:12.400
Look who's talking, after
kissing me out of nowhere.

00:22:19.510 --> 00:22:20.510
Right, right.

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:22.740
Good boy, just be honest.

00:22:27.530 --> 00:22:28.530
Hey.

00:22:29.850 --> 00:22:30.850
Asleep again?

00:22:34.510 --> 00:22:35.510
You know, Ryo...

00:22:36.280 --> 00:22:37.280
Hmm?

00:22:38.773 --> 00:22:40.463
Did you used to...

00:22:41.200 --> 00:22:42.710
flirt with everyone like this?

00:22:51.170 --> 00:22:52.270
Somehow...

00:22:55.050 --> 00:22:56.050
it kind of pisses me off.

00:22:58.930 --> 00:22:59.930
From now on,

00:23:01.280 --> 00:23:02.840
you're only allowed to do this with me.

00:23:04.290 --> 00:23:05.290
Okay?

00:23:09.900 --> 00:23:11.000
Zen...

00:23:13.010 --> 00:23:13.460
I...

00:23:13.490 --> 00:23:15.429
You didn't actually think
I'd say that, did you?

00:23:15.430 --> 00:23:16.430
Idiot.

00:23:17.570 --> 00:23:18.570
I'm going home.

00:23:19.640 --> 00:23:22.810
- Come on, stay the night.
- No way.

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:23.950
Who would want to stay here?

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:48.650
See ya.

00:24:12.000 --> 00:24:14.099
(Riku: Yotsuya Ryo, you know
where we're meeting tomorrow, right?)

00:24:14.100 --> 00:24:16.199
(Yotsuya Ryo: It's in Setagaya, right?)

00:24:16.200 --> 00:24:18.300
(Riku: Great. Don't get the hotel wrong!)

00:24:35.700 --> 00:24:42.000
(Yotsuya Ryo: Fat chance! I'll see you then.)

00:25:47.320 --> 00:25:48.476
(Next Episode)
You're pretty confident.

00:25:48.500 --> 00:25:50.266
(EP3: Didn't I tell you to
only have eyes for me?)

00:25:50.290 --> 00:25:51.746
Try harder to seduce me
with those sweet words.

00:25:51.770 --> 00:25:54.950
As it turned out, I got invited and asked
if I wanted to get a drink together later.

00:25:55.330 --> 00:25:56.860
I didn't think you
were so proactive.

00:25:57.010 --> 00:25:58.110
Oh, Shido-san.

00:25:58.130 --> 00:25:59.969
Thank you for coming all this way.

00:25:59.970 --> 00:26:01.490
I didn't know you two knew each other.

00:26:01.820 --> 00:26:03.416
Did something happen
between you and Yotsuya-san?

00:26:03.440 --> 00:26:06.210
- Don't act like we're friends.
- Shut up.

00:26:07.840 --> 00:26:08.840
Stop it.

00:26:08.950 --> 00:26:10.340
You're clearly having a reaction.

00:26:10.560 --> 00:26:12.300
I'm Yotsuya, nice to meet you.